        "text": "No new permit may be issued once the receipted cost has reached the cap. Reaching the cap exactly counts as reached."
      },
      {
        "id": "code",
        "hash": "5e9787264ffd4874f6f59777a1455aa7d3339aaca8a4551fe7612b84dcb6ae87",
        "text": "def cap_reached(spent, cap):\n    return spent > cap\n\ndef issue(ledger, cap):\n    if cap_reached(ledger.spent, cap):\n        raise PermitError(\"cumulative_cap_exceeded\")\n    return ledger.new_permit()"
